Converter toiri hoye geche ar test-e pass koreche: [scripts/md2gdoc.py](scripts/md2gdoc.py). Ek command-e ekta design kora Google Doc banay:
- prothom page-e doc-er title;
- navy, blue ar teal rong-er heading;
- key-value info thakle table, header row navy rong-er;
- [V], [A] ar [I] label alada rong-e: shobuj, neel ar komla;
- citation-gulo chhoto dhusor lekhay;
- "Takeaway" ekta rong kora box-e.

Test korar jonno duto chhoto doc baniyechilam. Dekhte thik ache dekhe dutoi Trash-e pathiye diyechi.

Erpor je kono topic-er jonno ek command-ei doc banano jabe. Command-ta `CLAUDE.md`-teo likhe rekhechi.

5 jon writer ekhono reading guide likhche: 23-ti paper-er summary, overview, gap ar glossary. Lekha shesh holei sob mile ekta Google Doc banabo, ar "anyone with link: view" diye public link pathabo.

Hyan, research cholar shomoy prottek paper-er bistarito analysis kora hoyechilo. Kintu se-gulo ekjon gobeshoker kaje lagar moto kore lekha, notun kaw porar moto kore na:

- **Ja age theke ache:**
  - prottek paper-er jonno `papers/<key>/analysis.md`, 14-ti section-e pray 3,000 shobder technical analysis;
  - shob paper mile ekta evidence matrix (204-ti tottho-r table);
  - ekta gap report;
  - ekta final research report.

  Egulor uddeshyo chilo protiti tottho-r praman page number soho dhore rakha, jate kono kichu bananor shujog na thake. Tai bhasha khub technical, ar lekha onek file-e chhoriye ache.
- **Ja ebar notun hocche:**
  - oi analysis-gulo theke shohoj bhashay 1–2 page-er summary;
  - shob kichu ekta doc-e shajano;
  - ekta public Google Doc link.

  Ei dhap-ta research pipeline-e chilo na, tai age hoyni.

Ekhon theke chaile eta automatic kora jay. Prottek notun research project-er shesh-e reading guide ar Google Doc link nijei toiri hobe, alada kore bolte hobe na. Eta korte research workflow-e ekta dhap jog korte hobe (research-report skill-e).

Eta ki kore debo? Kaj-ta chhoto. Totokkhone ei project-er doc-er kaj cholte thakbe.

