content.text:
Apnar research-er puro reading guide toiri, ar link-ta public: **https://docs.google.com/document/d/1h_QbexTziTB5n6Saf-baVXABIko_hwp9n4k79acxSeA/edit**

Link jar kache thakbe se porte parbe, kintu edit korte parbe na. Doc-ta apnar nijer Google account-e ache.

**Doc-e ki ache (196 page):**
1. **Overview:** research-ta kiser, 5-ti research question-er uttor ar prottek uttor-er praman koto strong, 23-ti paper-er map, kon 5-ti paper age porben, ar kothay gobeshona-gulo ekmot na.
2. **23-ti paper-er summary (1–2 page kore):**
   - ek line-e mul kotha, ar author, venue, peer-reviewed kina tar ekta table;
   - shohoj bhashay paper-ta ki niye, kivabe koreche, ki data use koreche;
   - mul ফল (findings), page number soho;
   - durbolota, ar paper-ta kon kon prosno-r uttor deyni (gap);
   - apnar kaje keno dorkar, ar onno paper-gulor sathe somporko.
3. **Gap ar sujog:**
   - 8-ti gap (G1–G8): prottek-tay ki kora jay, notun gobeshok hisebe study design, koto shohoje kora jabe, ki jhuki ache;
   - cyber security topic;
   - porer dhap-er checklist, ar je paper-gulo pore jog kora uchit.
4. **Glossary:** pray 75-ti technical shobder shohoj mane, ar ei review-er nijer limitation.
5. **Appendix A–C:** puro research report, method-gulor tulona, ar 204-ti dabir evidence table. Prottek dabi page number soho, tai paper likhte gele source khuje pete shubidha hobe.

Prottek tottho-r pashe label ache, rong alada kore:
- **[V] shobuj:** paper-er nijer data-y check kora;
- **[A] neel:** author-er dabi, amra check korte parini;
- **[I] komla:** amader nijer byakkha.

Doc-er local copy-o rakha ache: `reports/reading-guide-2026-11-12.pdf` ar `.md`.

**Porer research-gulor jonno:** ekhon theke prottek project-er shesh-e eki rokom doc nijei toiri hobe, ar public link apnake deya hobe. Pore notun kichu jog korte hole notun doc lagbe na, ei doc-er shesh-ei jog kora jabe.

**Apnar siddhanto ekhono dorkar:**
- 19-ti notun paper (security topic-er jonno aro 7-ti) project-e jog korbo kina.
- Security topic diye notun project shuru korbo kina.
